.. _logcollector:

   - logcollector.loop_timeout

       **Default:** 2

   - logcollector.open_attempts

       **Default:** 8

   - logcollector.max_wildcard_files

       Maximum number of files that a single wildcard ``<location>`` pattern may monitor simultaneously (range 1 to 100000). Matches beyond this limit are ignored and logged, preventing file descriptor exhaustion. ``ossec-logcollector`` automatically adjusts its open file descriptor limit to accommodate configured files up to this boundary.

       **Default:** 256

   - logcollector.remote_commands=0

       Allow the agents to run commands defined in ``agent.conf``.

       **Allowed:** 0,1

       **Default:** 0

       .. note::

           This option first appeared in OSSEC 2.7.



